Epoch_sequential
├── given the active strategy is local to Parent
├── and depositor A deposits in epoch 1 and claims shares at 1:1 price
├── and the protocol accrues 100% yield between epochs
├── and depositor B deposits in epoch 2 at the updated share price
├── when both epochs close
├── then both epochs should be CLAIMABLE and epoch 3 OPEN
├── and depositor A should hold the same share balance
├── and depositor B should hold the same share count as A (at double price)
└── and deposit mappings from prior epochs should be cleared
